I put my phone away.
The café is very cozy.
It is pleasantly warm in here.
The coffee is on the table in front of me.
It is hot and strong.
That is exactly how I like it.
Then I try the chocolate cake.
The piece is really big.
The cake tastes fantastic.
It is sweet, but not too sweet.
I look out of the large window.
But in here the atmosphere is nice.
Quiet music is playing in the background.
I eat my cake very slowly.
I take my time.
I enjoy this quiet moment.
